hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"341","Abd al-Warith ibn Abd al-Samad ibn Abd al-Warith al-Anbari told me, my father told me, al-Hussein told me, he said: Ibn Buraidah said, Abd told us God Al-Muzani, that the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “Do not let the Bedouins prevail over you regarding the name of the Maghrib prayer.” He said: The Bedouins say: It is dinner. Abu Bakr said: Abdullah Al-Muzani is Abdullah bin Al-Mughaffal."
